      "value": "From what i could get from the LOG this part stood out in the end right after attempting to join another public instance:\n2020.11.23 00:18:53 Log        -  [VRCFlowManagerVRC] Waiting for players to have network data\n2020.11.23 00:18:53 Log        -  [Always] Memory Usage: after world loaded [wrld_741d3d28-76e9-4644-b83e-df14da005499]\n- System.GC.GetTotalMemory: 166.97 MB\n- Profiler.GetMonoUsed/HeapSizeLong: 166.97 MB / 469.59 MB\n- Profiler.GetTotalAllocated/Reserved/UnusedMemoryLong: 1.10 GB / 1.56 GB / 469.16 MB\n- SystemInfo.graphicsMemorySize: 8079\n- SystemInfo.systemMemorySize:16335\n2020.11.23 00:18:53 Log        -  [VRCFlowManagerVRC] Finished entering world.\n2020.11.23 00:18:53 Error      -  [API] [4190, 401, Get, 2] Request Finished with Error!\nhttps://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/avatars/avtr_546ea8b1-57cf-4441-8ce0-868fcb0db800?apiKey=JlE5Jldo5Jibnk5O5hTx6XVqsJu4WJ26&organization=vrchat\nNo Exception\n{{\"error\":{{\"message\":\"\\\"Missing Credentials\\\"\",\"status_code\":401}}}}",
