      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We can easily reproduce this issue on some instances, not all. The player is then loaded in a giant black sphere far outside the world spawn (which would be 0,0,0 in our world). Post processing, Udon etc. is never initialized. You can't see/open the menu. Opening the menu teleports you back into the sphere. I asked a user with mods to use noclip to fly outside and they managed to get away from the phere and into the world after an extreme far travel. You can always see that black sphere in the distance.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
